#ASSERT `the penalty in place of death for` `s2` EQUALS JUST `imprisonment for life`
#ASSERT `an offence within s 3(2)` `s2` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT (`the death penalty position for` `s2`)'s `death may be imposed` EQUALS JUST FALSE

